  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The person in distress is mapped as the embodiment of the consequence of violence",
  "description": "The text 'violence is never the answer' is juxtaposed with the visual of a distressed person holding their head. The mapping suggests that the person's suffering represents the negative outcome or consequence of resorting to violence, thereby visually embodying the message that violence leads to distress. This is an analogical mapping where the visual entity (distressed_person_holding_head) is mapped onto the textual concept (the answer to violence being violence itself, which is negative).",
